{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"\"*Darken the city, night is a wire\nSteam in the subway, earth is a afire\nDo do do do do do do dodo dododo dodo\n\nWoman, you want me, give me a sign\nAnd catch my breathing even closer behind\nDo do do do do do do dodo dododo dodo\n\nIn touch with the ground\nI'm on the hunt I'm after you\nSmell like I sound, I'm lost in a crowd\nAnd I'm hungry like the wolf\n\nStraddle the line in discord and rhyme\nI'm on the hunt I'm after you\nMouth is alive, with juices like wine\nAnd I'm hungry like the wolf*\"\n\nHe shampoos his hair and scrubs the gunpowder off his hands.","created_at":"2021-07-18T16:25:17.720000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866354956474253332","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"\"*Stalked in the forest, too close to hide\nI'll be upon you by the moonlight side\nDo do do do do do do dodo dododo dodo\n\nHigh blood drumming on your skin, it's so tight\nYou feel my heat, I'm just a moment behind\nDo do do do do do do dodo dododo dodo\n\nIn touch with the ground\nI'm on the hunt I'm after you\nA scent and a sound, I'm lost and I'm found\nAnd I'm hungry like the wolf\n\nStrut on a line, it's discord and rhyme\nI howl and I whine, I'm after you\nMouth is alive, all running inside\nAnd I'm hungry like the wolf\n\nBurning the ground, I break from the crowd\nI'm on the hunt, I'm after you\nI smell like I sound, I'm lost and I'm found\nAnd I'm hungry like the wolf\n\nStrut on a line, it's discord and rhyme\nI'm on the hunt, I'm after you\nMouth is alive, with juices like wine\nAnd I'm hungry like the wolf\n\nBurning the ground, I break from the crowd\nI'm on the hunt, I'm after you\nScent and a sound, I'm lost and I'm found\nAnd I'm hungry like the wolf\n\nStrut on a line, it's discord and rhyme\nI'm on the hunt, I'm after you\nMouth is alive all running inside\nand I'm hungry like the wolf*\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T16:27:15.248000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866355449423069214","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"Cairn dries off himself and dresses for the day, hiding the Celtic knotted wave themed studded leather under their usual suit and tie. It is surprisingly, unnoticeable hardly visible except a for a hint of embroidery around the collar, hidden largely by his shirt and tie.","created_at":"2021-07-18T16:29:52.372000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866356108447973406","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"He tucks the revolver in his belt line behind his back and pulls his jacket coat tails over to conceal the weapon.","created_at":"2021-07-18T16:30:59.585000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866356390360776705","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"Cairn looks at himself in the mirror and says, \"Missing something...\" he takes out the paints and paints a beautiful rapier with Celtic triskelion patterns and a hilt shaped like a wolf's head. The design of the scabbard and hilt make the sword look and function more like a cane than a weapon. (Statistically identical to rapier commonly worth 25gp)","created_at":"2021-07-18T16:37:13.367000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-18T16:37:37.958000Z","id":"866357958115852348","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
