{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"Fuddles looks around a little then gets into the showers. As she showers she sings a song of home.","created_at":"2021-07-20T18:30:43.001000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867111295521390662","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"If you ever go across the sea to Ireland Then maybe at the closing of your day You will sit and watch the moon rise over Claddagh And watch the barefoot gossoons at their play Just to hear again the ripple of the trout stream The women in the meadows making hay And to sit beside a turf fire in the cabin And see the sun go down on Galway Bay For the breezes blowing over the seas from Ireland Are perfumed by the heather as they blow And the women in the uplands diggin' prates Speak a language that the strangers do not know For the strangers came and tried to teach us their way They scorned us just for being what we are But they might as well go chasing after moonbeams Or light a penny candle from a star And if there is going to be a life hereafter And faith I am sure there's going to be I will ask my God to let me make my heaven In that dear land across the Irish sea","created_at":"2021-07-20T18:30:56.342000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867111351477207040","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"Cairn enters in and removes his holster and sets it on the bar. Nearly immediately, he hears singing from the shower. A grin spreads across his face. He recognizes the voice and the songs she sings. He pours two fine aged scotch whiskeys and sits at the bar. Not wanting to violate Fuddles' privacy, he simply sits at the bar, plucking pizzicato on the violin and sweetly harmonizing along. He raises his volume as to carry through the door and reach Fuddles' ears.","created_at":"2021-07-20T19:12:14.961000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-20T19:13:10.610000Z","id":"867121747558793216","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"Cairn takes out a piece of paper and pen and writes a note || Fuddles, You sing like angel. Thank you for always having my back. || He takes out his paints and makes a rose colored sundress with Celtic embroidery. He weights down the note with the glass of whiskey and next to it, places the dress to display neatly across the bar. He paints a single pink long stem rose and lays it on the dress. He leaves the room to grant her a bit of privacy, so she might try it on after she emerges.","created_at":"2021-07-20T19:28:23.461000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867125809743134762","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"As she hears the sings she quickly gets out of the shower. She says to herself  \"Damit to hell, I knew I was in there to long.\" She get dress and peeks out the door. \"Ummm sorry sonny I....oh\" she sees he is not there and steps out. As she steps out she notices the beautiful dress. She walks over a and picks up the note and flower and smells it as she reads the note. She smiles. She puts down the note and flower and picks up the dress. She hold it to herself and spins. \"Its lovely.\" She goes and puts it on and spins around. She leaves to go find sonny.","created_at":"2021-07-20T19:38:39.915000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867128395339268136","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"Cairn enters in the room with Fuddles.","created_at":"2021-07-21T06:07:39.383000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867286686139940865","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"\"You can have the couch. I'll take the floor.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T06:07:54.662000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867286750223925249","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"\"Oh. You don't have to do that. I can sleep on the floor.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T06:10:07.325000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867287306652876810","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"“No I insist. My mother raised me with manners.”","created_at":"2021-07-21T06:10:43.858000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867287459885088768","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"\"I have slept on worse.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T06:10:55.281000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867287507796361216","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"“I once slept in a barn in Wales. hehe” there’s a long awkward pause.","created_at":"2021-07-21T06:12:13.430000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867287835576500224","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"“ I… I just don’t want to be alone tonight.”","created_at":"2021-07-21T06:13:11.232000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867288078014742529","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"She nods \" When I couldnt find you. I thought something horrible happened to you.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T06:14:42.499000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867288460817989632","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"“I thought… I don’t want to lose you.”","created_at":"2021-07-21T06:15:37.299000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867288690664407060","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"“That was the closest I’ve ever come to dying.”","created_at":"2021-07-21T06:16:03.850000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867288802027896842","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"“People say here it isn’t the end, but…”","created_at":"2021-07-21T06:16:24.181000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867288887302815754","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"“I don’t want to die. Not yet.”","created_at":"2021-07-21T06:16:39.135000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867288950024175666","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"\"Its scary. Why do we do this to ourselves. \"","created_at":"2021-07-21T06:16:48.500000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867288989303701556","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"“I thought I was helping.”","created_at":"2021-07-21T06:17:01.711000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867289044714127370","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"“But I dragged you and all our friends into that craziness.”","created_at":"2021-07-21T06:17:35.821000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T06:17:44.006000Z","id":"867289187782361122","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"\"You were things just did go in our fab this time.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T06:17:42.176000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867289214437556274","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"\"You didn't drag me. I wouldn't have let you go without me.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T06:18:08.078000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867289323078680597","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"\"I wanted to help you.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T06:18:21.860000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867289380884054028","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"865093578405838868","content":"“I’m so used to things just working out, I didn’t stop to think about what I was risking.”","created_at":"2021-07-21T06:18:23.948000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867289389642022952","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
